                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a2896969-d9d5-3dd5-aeb3-79cf47eb0172",
                        "entry_id": "65c9c102-55f5-3538-8d04-ac6443a70e25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "skierowany na końcu ku górze"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3706e241-d6d4-400c-b3b6-096ef449756c",
                        "source_entry_id": "65c9c102-55f5-3538-8d04-ac6443a70e25",
                        "source_sense_id": "a2896969-d9d5-3dd5-aeb3-79cf47eb0172",
                        "target_lang_word": "snub",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "snub",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c01f9c88-b7ac-372d-86a0-48b9826b22db",
                                        "entry_id": "a3326423-9b2d-33f8-a585-4486a8f237de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To slight, ignore or behave coldly toward someone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d6f813a-0878-484e-ba67-5646902fcb84",
                                                "sense_id": "c01f9c88-b7ac-372d-86a0-48b9826b22db",
                                                "text": "When, therefore, the First Secretary sounded him as to the expediency of some step in the direction of a firmer political combination than that at present existing,—by which of course was meant the dethronement of the present Prime Minister,—Mr. Roby had snubbed him!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20fa2da7-9b17-4ffb-a46a-3e7d16c47a66",
                                                "sense_id": "c01f9c88-b7ac-372d-86a0-48b9826b22db",
                                                "text": "For near three mortal months have you trifled with my feelings, eluded me, and snubbed me; and I won’t stand it!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0188f436-4b4a-45bf-979c-4718d6e1264c",
                                                "sense_id": "c01f9c88-b7ac-372d-86a0-48b9826b22db",
                                                "text": "Lily was sure that within twenty-four hours the story of her visiting her dress-maker at the Benedick would be in active circulation among Mr. Rosedale’s acquaintances. The worst of it was that she had always snubbed and ignored him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "281d2153-c90d-4460-a519-208e9ce1b655",
                                                "sense_id": "c01f9c88-b7ac-372d-86a0-48b9826b22db",
                                                "text": "For a long time he lived in the toy cupboard or on the nursery floor, and no one thought very much about him. He was naturally shy, and being only made of velveteen, some of the more expensive toys quite snubbed him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54a798a4-1de9-35cf-b52e-dd626ce0019c",
                                        "entry_id": "a3326423-9b2d-33f8-a585-4486a8f237de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To turn down insultingly; to dismiss."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b65c7f94-7894-4d5a-a3a9-9204201cfcd4",
                                                "sense_id": "54a798a4-1de9-35cf-b52e-dd626ce0019c",
                                                "text": "He snubbed my offer of help."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c28f1c7e-3a2a-43b2-80ec-df80fcddc568",
                                                "sense_id": "54a798a4-1de9-35cf-b52e-dd626ce0019c",
                                                "text": "The joke is on those who snub books which, judged by their covers, are written for the mass market. Mineshaft is the finest satire in gay literature."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfe39fd9-9791-3f4d-bbdc-7033d3da0c3c",
                                        "entry_id": "a3326423-9b2d-33f8-a585-4486a8f237de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To check; to reprimand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01f12f78-1a40-37e3-b422-8a51b9fa01b8",
                                        "entry_id": "a3326423-9b2d-33f8-a585-4486a8f237de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To stub out (a cigarette etc)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4a62640-a75c-399c-9d04-8d5eb5ce8c02",
                                        "entry_id": "a3326423-9b2d-33f8-a585-4486a8f237de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To halt the movement of a rope etc by turning it about a cleat or bollard etc; to secure a vessel in this manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a945535-7f54-37c2-bde2-c481995ed28a",
                                        "entry_id": "a3326423-9b2d-33f8-a585-4486a8f237de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To clip or break off the end of; to check or stunt the growth of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "snub",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb86965e-e63f-3069-9644-a8548965d35a",
                                        "entry_id": "a3477613-eb4c-3a81-a3d4-2320e8fae268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Conspicuously short."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f875666-981b-40c1-82a9-11cb8bef22f5",
                                                "sense_id": "cb86965e-e63f-3069-9644-a8548965d35a",
                                                "text": "a snub-nosed revolver"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aaf9c1f3-3d52-39fe-8cec-e3d2306edc6a",
                                        "entry_id": "a3477613-eb4c-3a81-a3d4-2320e8fae268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Flat and broad, with the end slightly turned up."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a nose"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11527e37-ea3e-44c5-8bca-5e1ac6a3d1ed",
                                                "sense_id": "aaf9c1f3-3d52-39fe-8cec-e3d2306edc6a",
                                                "text": "It was even less easy to fix the impression in the case of the man at the right end of the table, who, to say truth, was as commonplace a person as could be seen anywhere, with a round, brown-haired head and a round snub nose, but also clad in clerical black, of a stricter cut."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec41a892-103e-45e2-afb4-a030e0bb173b",
                                                "sense_id": "aaf9c1f3-3d52-39fe-8cec-e3d2306edc6a",
                                                "text": "If I close my eyes I can see Marie today as I saw her then. Round, rosy face, snub nose, dark hair piled up in a chignon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c122b573-eff6-3c17-a22a-ced697f71485",
                                        "entry_id": "a3477613-eb4c-3a81-a3d4-2320e8fae268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Derived from a simpler polyhedron by the addition of extra triangular faces."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a polyhedron"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "snub",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "469ee085-7c6f-322a-b5aa-bc333238c93b",
                                        "entry_id": "a364b475-f8e7-3674-a997-c00264166d39",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A deliberate affront or slight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cebb9dc9-a63e-4089-a8cc-a7ddfd033e49",
                                                "sense_id": "469ee085-7c6f-322a-b5aa-bc333238c93b",
                                                "text": "It was part of Evelyn’s character that in spite of many snubs which she received or imagined, she never gave up the pursuit of people she wanted to know, and in the long run generally succeeded in knowing them and even in making them like her."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a186d3f-b2d5-407e-b8e9-fd86a7af21a8",
                                                "sense_id": "469ee085-7c6f-322a-b5aa-bc333238c93b",
                                                "text": "I hope the people we couldn't invite don't see it as a snub."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b52bc7c-6c9a-426f-a95e-3b607dec605e",
                                                "sense_id": "469ee085-7c6f-322a-b5aa-bc333238c93b",
                                                "text": "The bluntness of King Vajiralongkorn's intervention—and the determination it reveals to resist relatively small checks on royal power—is both a snub to the junta and a worry for democrats, some of whom had dared hope that the new king might be happy to take a back seat in public life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d17c3ff1-a0fd-4e2e-998a-6165c98ea0e2",
                                                "sense_id": "469ee085-7c6f-322a-b5aa-bc333238c93b",
                                                "text": "The snub from a traditional ally to Putin, who had hosted an inconsequential meeting of the warring countries’ leaders last month, comes immediately on the back of his disastrous summit with six former Soviet states."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80392024-3eaf-383b-ad34-fb0be6a48301",
                                        "entry_id": "a364b475-f8e7-3674-a997-c00264166d39",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden checking of a cable or rope."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7118c676-5c59-3606-98f9-a2f5827a6096",
                                        "entry_id": "a364b475-f8e7-3674-a997-c00264166d39",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A knot; a protuberance; a snag."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07b2919c-f657-4167-91a8-d31be18c59a5",
                                                "sense_id": "7118c676-5c59-3606-98f9-a2f5827a6096",
                                                "text": "[A club] with ragged snubs and knotty grain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "snub",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15328409-6223-36cc-a902-de2d14415ede",
                                        "entry_id": "2ab0c98f-d63c-384e-9edd-c24e8837d3a4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sob with convulsions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b406795-d431-4f5c-be0d-a733050158f0",
                                                "sense_id": "15328409-6223-36cc-a902-de2d14415ede",
                                                "text": "He striveth, strugleth, roareth, sobbeth, snubbeth, and ready he is to burst for anger."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "17acb010-540c-4559-aeb7-4b5a8682b4f7",
                        "source_entry_id": "65c9c102-55f5-3538-8d04-ac6443a70e25",
                        "source_sense_id": "a2896969-d9d5-3dd5-aeb3-79cf47eb0172",
                        "target_lang_word": "retroussé",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "retroussé",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "800a1414-6fa8-3159-aa5c-deecbfc25fe2",
                                        "entry_id": "53a0dcfe-df9e-3678-9b44-dde4a8a61927",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie un nez dont le bout est un peu relevé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b5c6356-a6a5-465a-80c9-0932563f67c0",
                                                "sense_id": "800a1414-6fa8-3159-aa5c-deecbfc25fe2",
                                                "text": "Son visage est tout rond et tout rose et son nez est si retroussé qu’on dit, et ça l’amuse, qu’à travers lui on lit dans sa tête ses pensées."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc3ccddb-7f84-3981-96ad-25345cefd1e9",
                                        "entry_id": "53a0dcfe-df9e-3678-9b44-dde4a8a61927",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ramené, remonté, s’agissant d’un vêtement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8dc6cd3-de27-4b6f-9407-8986b96973a8",
                                                "sense_id": "fc3ccddb-7f84-3981-96ad-25345cefd1e9",
                                                "text": "Fandor, le pantalon retroussé, le col du pardessus relevé, traversait stoïquement sous la pluie l’esplanade des Invalides."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "retroussé",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c81e3980-2048-38d4-bfe4-fa9415e13010",
                                        "entry_id": "0b3bbb3c-0475-3f67-bf7e-672b9b2d5da9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Résultat de l’action de retrousser un vêtement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a23a6274-30ba-49a6-9371-5dc97d748457",
                                                "sense_id": "c81e3980-2048-38d4-bfe4-fa9415e13010",
                                                "text": "Dans ces moments-là, les jambes me démangent, je me sens le diable au corps et le corps plein de rythme, mon esprit aussi cabriole et chahute, et cela va si loin que je dois me retenir, de toute ma raison, pour ne pas m’élancer élastique et prompt, sur l’étroit parquet, et mêler mes lancements de bras et mes grands écarts aux jambes en l’air et aux retroussés savants de ces créatures dont je me sens si près, par mille côtés indéfinissables : goûts, souvenirs et désirs tout ensemble."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
